<description>&lt;p&gt;Arrests continue as Peshawar ATC reissued an arrest warrant for Sohail Afridi in the Radio Pakistan attack, while police faced lethal attacks in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, with eleven police personnel feared killed in one incident and twelve injured in another in Kohat. Strikes by lawyers oppose the suspension of provincial health commission powers, and a general strike by Spaniards reflects broader unrest but is unrelated to the local conflict. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOTGVJM3dIVThPbkNqYXlOYzFhVEIxd1ZidEVWNjZwSzJHM3o0WndJcHlNMHRyVGRKbVVNTHlTMWZ2VWE5Zm9sY2dPS1IxcXh6WEl5bl9LRk1nNWpKTlZlLU9kLXIxMW81d1Byc2VFQXU1RVNYaldaR2hhQlg3ZGE4a3JueEVxN282bkRFU0d6ZHBJcVhLMTI3dkN0ZDU5MlZlMDlYaVVoLW9CMHlyY2FFbTNKdHlDXzhvajJ0TVFQV3FzOUd0NjJOVURJMGY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNdHVOb3F2MVpGZ0s0N3hWOWFOMEJxZkJkNHFEVk1RNlcxR0ZEb0lTNl9GQlpkbExVMDNzMzNCSHEyNmhvM2VoQ21yZ2VHa293Sjkxbk9yZjVuSk1PcG1oZGdFcC05VEpMNml0a01kVHlzNXhrbEFTSXdZMS0wVGNCTVFPcGllTGlkQUp4VEdBYmNTSzBpeVd3UA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOcDlvUk1pMWltemdZU1IyVVRiQ25CRkVMdFBxcHhmeWtpVnk4MFNPZHBwZU1LMkxjNmZSRE0wUnpIN2J1UzF6cXNxQWVUY1Zjbi15X3g5VnZ1TFNNNkFTb2RSUzVuMEZ2ZUZQWERLemk5OXE2bkp6OENmMlUxalhtYjNET0Q4clo2bWdqTjF2YjgwSXBVVlR2RnVHa1Y5TjlVcFF3MU5VcGJPR2MtaVVYWnN1bll2RE1UMGRFVWJWbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBfZ3R5Qlc1LUZ6emoyaE1CSHZtUk93aE9VX1ZLb09DMEtvaTNTQ0sxcFlVVk82NWI3an